course: dictionary
lesson: 6462
title: Nasty: one word, many meanings
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: One word can have more than one meaning. Context, the words around it, tells you which meaning the writer wants. «The bin had a nasty smell.» The clue is smell, so nasty means very unpleasant to smell.
explain: «She made a nasty comment about my hair.» The clue is comment, which is something said. Nasty here means unkind and mean, and it hurts the person who hears it.
explain: «He had a nasty fall in the playground.» The clue is fall. Nasty means bad, serious or dangerous, and a fall like that might need first aid. Try each meaning in the sentence and see which one fits.
fact: Nasty is an adjective, so it describes a noun, like «a nasty smell».
fact: «Nasty» can mean very unpleasant to see, smell, taste or feel.
fact: «Nasty» can mean unkind and mean, like «a nasty comment».
fact: «Nasty» can mean bad, serious or dangerous, like «a nasty cut».
fact: The comparison forms are nastier and nastiest.
exercise: «The bin had a nasty smell.» What does nasty mean here? | Very loud | Very tall and thin | *Very unpleasant to smell
exercise: «She made a nasty comment about my hair.» What does nasty mean here? | Very cold | Sweet and kind | *Unkind and mean
exercise: «He had a nasty fall in the playground.» What does nasty mean here? | *Bad, serious or dangerous | Funny and silly | Very quiet
test: «Some tiger moths warn bats that they taste nasty.» What does nasty mean here? | Bad and serious | Soft and fluffy | Unkind and mean | *Very unpleasant to taste
test: A girl in Brisbane got nasty messages in a game chat. What did she do? | *She did not answer, took screenshots and showed her dad | She deleted the game | She sent nasty messages back | She left the school
exam: Theo typed a long nasty message to a player who beat him, then deleted every word and sent «gg» instead. Why was deleting the nasty message a good choice? | *It would have been unkind and would have hurt another player | It would have been too short to read | It would have made the game faster | It was a nice message that he wanted to keep
